  <result type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDG Target 16.3 PGAs Campaign to Abolish the Death Penalty contributes to abolish the use of capital punishment, widen parliamentary support for international instruments on abolition and ensures that abolitionist countries, which apply a moratorium, do not reintroduce capital punishment in their criminal laws or resume executions.</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="276857" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">PGA member-parliamentarians take concrete actions in support of national legislative initiatives in an ODA-eligible country for the abolition of the death penalty or moratorium on capital punishment, such as in Guyana and Morocco.</narrative>
